      "id": "record-before-refresh",
      "path": "server/src/Api/VouchersController.cs",
      "startLine": 22,
      "text": "RecordVoucher runs before the account total refresh so the refreshed total already includes the new voucher. Swapping the two calls would show the old total until the next reload."
    },
    {
      "id": "single-insert",
      "path": "server/src/Services/VoucherService.cs",
      "startLine": 27,
      "text": "The voucher is written as one row in the same unit of work as the validation. Likely kept in one transaction so a rejected amount never leaves a partial Voucher behind."
    },
